/-! # Discovery data for 1155 conjugates of the third max2 quotient involution

Every row is connected to the native marked quotient word by an earlier
conjugation edge. Only 12-dimensional matrices occur. `NativeQuotientOrbit`
checks the edges and distinctness before using them as a lower class bound.
Source: the native ATLAS max2 quotient; Kleidman--Wilson (1988), Table 1.
-/

